infinite-patch 1
# Psytrance Rolling Saw Bass Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.25
  i steps 16
  i note0 38
  i note1 38
  i note2 38
  i note3 38
  i note4 38
  i note5 38
  i note6 38
  i note7 50
  i note8 38
  i note9 38
  i note10 38
  i note11 38
  i note12 38
  i note13 38
  i note14 41
